OL,3,GNEWSAGrandparent hugging consent ad
OL,4,Apulled after criticism
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Irish minister for justice has
OL,7,Fcriticised an advertisement produced by
OL,8,Fthe Dublin Rape Crisis Centre (DRCC)
OL,9,Fpromoting consent, calling it
OL,10,F"inappropriate and demeaning to
OL,11,Fgrandparents".
OL,13,FThe ad depicts two grandparents
OL,14,Fenthusiastically hugging a young boy,
OL,15,Fbut when they approach their
OL,16,Fgranddaughter she appears unhappy about
OL,17,Fthe exchange.
OL,19,FIt includes the message "not everyone
OL,20,Fwants a hug. Even from the people who
OL,21,Flove them".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
