OL,3,GNEWSAGrandparent hugging consent ad
OL,4,Apulled after criticism
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ad, which has since been removed,
OL,7,Fhas attracted criticism and and also
OL,8,Freceived international coverage in
OL,9,Fpublications such as the New York Post.
